      "created_at": "2013-01-22T05:32:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was wondering the same thing but was going to wait another month or two before I asked ....</p><p>partially because i'm really excited for it ;) but also might give &gt;G an idea of demand for the print run.</p><p>(conversely, I don't know how much of a logistics issue it might be for &gt;G if they don't like tracking stuff with so much advance time or dealing with people who change their minds, etc.)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But, yeah, bottom line, if there is a place to preorder Shattered Timelines, I'd also be interested in such a thing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
