      "raw": "<p>We have decided not to do a \"pre-order\" for Shattered Timelines per-se (since tracking that through our web store is a huge pain). Instead, we'll just be putting Shattered Timelines (and all the new mini-expansions) up on the web store available for purchase as soon as the shipments come in from the printer. You'll then be able to order the game (though it won't ship out until after we ship out Kickstarter backer rewards).</p>",
